"""Large-quantity words.

The component is a detector for the word that names a big round number. Its
strongest response is to the ten-thousand unit: the Chinese 万 / 萬 and the Korean
만 (fires about 5-6). Compounds that contain 万 (十万, 千万, 万元, 百万, 万人) fire
more weakly (about 2.5). Western and foreign scale words (million, billion,
thousand, hundred, 亿, 千, millones, milhões, 백만) fire about 1, and the "of" right
after such a word ("millions of") fires about 1 as well. "population" fires about
0.8. Everything else is 0.

