Layer-0 MLP feature of layers.0.mlp.down_proj:3211. Its main job is to fire on a digit
token whose immediately preceding token (in the same document) is the digit "1", as in the
"9" of "1 9 8 4" or the "8" of "1 8 0 0". How strongly it fires depends on the digit that
follows the 1: "19" and "18" are strongest, "17" and "16" next, "15" weaker, "14" weak, and
